lator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025 the middle went from 24% of normal in January to February to 285% in March to April. Grid 16323 had its driest year in 2011, at 40% of normal.</p>"}
